Source: dlt-viewer
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               cmake,
               ninja-build,
               qt6-base-dev,
               qt6-serialport-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/COVESA/dlt-viewer
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dlt-viewer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libqdlt@SOVER@ (= ${binary:Version}),
         dlt-viewer-plugins (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: covesa-dlt-viewer
Replaces: covesa-dlt-viewer
Description: COVESA DLT Viewer
 Graphical client for DLT (Diagnostic Log and Trace, AUTOSAR) to receive,
 decode and analyse logs and traces from ECUs running a DLT daemon.

Package: dlt-commander
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libqdlt@SOVER@ (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: dlt-viewer-plugins (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: covesa-dlt-viewer
Description: COVESA DLT Viewer command line tool
 Command line front end to the DLT Viewer core: converts, filters and
 exports DLT files without a GUI. Uses the decoder plugins from
 dlt-viewer-plugins when installed.

Package: dlt-viewer-plugins
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libqdlt@SOVER@ (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: covesa-dlt-viewer
Description: COVESA DLT Viewer bundled plugins
 Plugins shipped with DLT Viewer (D-Bus, file transfer, non-verbose,
 test robot, viewer), installed in the system plugin directory
 /usr/lib/<multiarch>/dlt-viewer/plugins used by dlt-viewer and
 dlt-commander.

Package: libqdlt@SOVER@
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: COVESA DLT Viewer core library
 Shared library with the DLT parsing, connection and plugin infrastructure
 used by dlt-viewer, dlt-commander and all viewer plugins. The soname
 carries the viewer's major.minor version because the plugin ABI is not
 stable across viewer versions.

Package: libqdlt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         libqdlt@SOVER@ (= ${binary:Version}),
         qt6-base-dev,
         qt6-serialport-dev
Conflicts: covesa-dlt-viewer-dev
Replaces: covesa-dlt-viewer-dev
Description: COVESA DLT Viewer core library - development files
 Headers, pkg-config file (qdlt.pc) and linker symlink for building
 DLT Viewer plugins against the installed viewer. The plugin install
 directory is available as `pkg-config --variable=plugindir qdlt`.
